        </div>
        <div class="cert-card">
          <div class="cert-year">2025</div>
          <h3>Secure Software Design Specialization</h3>
          <p class="cert-issuer">University of Colorado</p>
          <p class="cert-desc">Advanced patterns in secure systems design, threat modeling, and cryptographic fundamentals for distributed systems.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cert-card">
          <div class="cert-year">2023</div>
